	I think that the problem is that the files have all objects marked as
"out" (IE, randomly dropped by monsters), rather than in the traders shop.
And looking at the code a little, it actually appears items will be removed
from the traders shop after a period of time, and marked as out, which seems
just dumb, IMHO. If you edit your item.start file, and change some of the
[-3] entries at the start of the line to [-4], and set the sector to 0,0 (right
after the [-3]), the items will appear in the traders shop that is to the left
of the home sector. Also, make sure and delete the item.save and item.old files
so that you will force the daemon to read the start file (or just edit your
item.save file).


